# Plant water-temperature points typed by the circuit they measure (BUG-1564).
#
# GENERATED by scripts/provision_plant_water_roles.py from the live graph: each point's
# circuit follows from the equipment it is a point of (chiller -> chilled water; boiler or
# heating heat pump -> hot water). Extra rdf:type triples only; nothing else is stated.
# Equipment kinds deliberately left untyped in this run: Boiler.

@prefix rdf:   <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix brick: <https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#> .
@prefix bldg:  <http://abacwsbuilding.cardiff.ac.uk/abacws#> .

bldg:Chiller_1_Entering_Water_Temperature rdf:type brick:Entering_Chilled_Water_Temperature_Sensor .
bldg:Chiller_1_Leaving_Water_Temperature rdf:type brick:Leaving_Chilled_Water_Temperature_Sensor .
bldg:Heat_Pump_1_Entering_Water_Temperature rdf:type brick:Entering_Hot_Water_Temperature_Sensor .
bldg:Heat_Pump_1_Leaving_Water_Temperature rdf:type brick:Leaving_Hot_Water_Temperature_Sensor .
